{"3557100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Serendia - Random Gear Defense", "steam_appid": 3557100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn every round and march toward your Crystal Tower.<br>Defend it against waves of increasingly stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you’ll receive a gear draw ticket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to obtain random gear materials, and upgrade your equipment to higher tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between enemy waves, there are moments of peace.<br>Take that time to enter the mine and collect valuable resources.<br>Mining provides various materials that help your character grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 rounds, a powerful boss will appear.<br>These bosses are extremely tough.<br>If you're struggling to defeat one, check if you're lacking boss-specific equipment or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7368118ec8e58b491270691765ef697f.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7368118ec8e58b491270691765ef697f.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7368118ec8e58b491270691765ef697f.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the Unique tier and up, each piece of gear has its own skill.<br>Use these unique skills strategically to build the ultimate gear combinations.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/7e83413b2350a7b4d76b23746f62dd36.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn every round and march toward your Crystal Tower.<br>Defend it against waves of increasingly stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/a21efc9cccc46e245f698294b4437e87.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you’ll receive a gear draw ticket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use it to obtain random gear materials, and upgrade your equipment to higher tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/48b4b0cba1ac9ddcb4a450035361f367.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between enemy waves, there are moments of peace.<br>Take that time to enter the mine and collect valuable resources.<br>Mining provides various materials that help your character grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.poster.avif?t=1784680474\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.webm?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/c282894cf14e345c77237b4f813dc332.mp4?t=1784680474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 rounds, a powerful boss will appear.<br>These bosses are extremely tough.<br>If you're struggling to defeat one, check if you're lacking boss-specific equipment or abilities.</p